{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:00 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n\n<p>最近連鎖便利店推出一系列黑芝麻甜品大受歡迎，掀起一股香濃的黑色飲食熱潮，也讓這種傳統食材成為熱話。黑芝麻作為一種常見的天然食材，功效多元且營養價值極高，以下為大家公開黑芝麻的6大健康好處及需要留意的食用禁忌，讓大家輕鬆吃出健康好體質。</p>\n<h2>黑芝麻鈣含量超越牛奶 富含鐵質與維生素有效抗氧化</h2>\n<p>黑芝麻在維持身體健康方面具備多項顯著功效，日常適量攝取能帶來以下好處：</p>\n<ul>\n<li> </li>\n<li> </li>\n<li> </li>\n<li> </li>\n<li> </li>\n<li> </li>\n</ul>\n<img alt=\"黑芝麻6大健康好處\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/784fa9984b93122c6dbe304bef2cba32/2026-09/image_1789099347924542.png\" title=\"黑芝麻6大健康好處\"/>\n<h2>2類人須留意 適量均衡攝取即可放心食用</h2>\n<p>黑芝麻作為健康的天然食材，基本上沒有嚴格的食用禁忌，也沒有研究顯示食用後會產生不良副作用。只要掌握每日適量與均衡飲食的原則，一般人都可以放心享用；不過仍有兩類人士需要特別多加留意：</p>\n<ul>\n<li> </li>\n<li> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>資料來源：otershop</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8ae49bcd274a69239ce9668dcd8167c/2024-10/1_6_23.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bce2fea284f9c26db85465963d17439/2024-10/3_8_14.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"維他脫脂奶 170mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/594069beee599514f19d488d4900a607/2024-10/110_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"維記脫脂奶 165mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f4754ebbfeaa45736ec1b2908109f74/2024-10/111_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"牛奶公司脫脂奶 154mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8e9c24e036e3ab6131a5469a5a21796/2024-10/112_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Daioni 有機脫脂奶 126mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80efa476e1d01be87a9f1709e0f781ce/2024-10/113_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"明治脫脂奶 120mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68aeb737793c763157835838af2df2b8/2024-10/114_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"十字牌脫脂奶 120mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d5e3b7cae1a9f62a93c17aa0b73d4d6c/2024-10/115_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"保利脫脂奶 120mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2af236fc017bb687f3aa87936e384b1e/2024-10/116_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Devondale 脫脂奶 120mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08453c0047d20b9b4015568f6a7fb0b3/2024-10/117_2.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/612395d14d8c90a3639d60e155220696/2024-10/4_8_9.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"安怡高鈣低脂奶 278mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bfa88e5dd05da5e2fde69f135eb9eeb/2024-10/118_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"牛奶公司高鈣低脂奶 190mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/961897c4df0b7a9ce12c8b290c0f20dc/2024-10/119_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"維他高鈣低脂奶 170mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/531ae31ca251f6182ece831b34c62de8/2024-10/120_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"十字牌高鈣低脂奶 170mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/616bb441e18f57208484bbb6724d85eb/2024-10/121_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"保利高鈣低脂UHT奶 140mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b2e105211995c3c6f862751c9e8370a/2024-10/122_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蒙牛低脂高鈣奶 125mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54173f4a5e7134202345204923e9e8f1/2024-10/123_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蒙牛低脂高鈣奶 125mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d24a032ebb5c3195ac8dfd85898b41e/2024-10/124_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"伊美瑞士半脫脂奶 120mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ea0e303645a99d1168ce1926dccb95c/2024-10/125_2.png\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T03:18:18.961336+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}